    "title": "Location Share",
    "description": "Location Share is a user-friendly app that allows you to easily share your location with friends or family you care about. Location sharing requires the mutual consent of both parties.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc6cReal-time location update: When you successfully share your location with your friends or family members, Location Share will update the location information of the family members or friends who share your location with you in real time, so that you can check their locations.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2Follow the location of friends or family members: After you add the location information of friends or family members to follow, if the location of friends or family members changes, Location Share will remind you through notifications. Of course, you can also turn off this notification reminder in the app.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0a My location: Of course, you can also check your location in the app.\r\n\r\n\u2705 USER-FRIENDLY INTERFACE: Our app is designed with simplicity and usability in mind. Easily manage your location sharing settings through our intuitive interface.\r\n\r\nDownload Location Share now!\r\n\r\nStatement:\r\n1. Location Share is an application that can only share location information with the consent of both parties.\r\n2.Location Share only needs a few permissions (mainly location permissions, notification permissions) to protect your network privacy.\r\n3.Location Share is not a spy or secret surveillance app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Location Share is a user-friendly app that allows you to easily share your location with friends or family you care about. Location sharing requires the mutual consent of both parties.<br><br>\ud83d\udc6cReal-time location update: When you successfully share your location with your friends or family members, Location Share will update the location information of the family members or friends who share your location with you in real time, so that you can check their locations.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf2Follow the location of friends or family members: After you add the location information of friends or family members to follow, if the location of friends or family members changes, Location Share will remind you through notifications. Of course, you can also turn off this notification reminder in the app.<br><br>\ud83d\ude0a My location: Of course, you can also check your location in the app.<br><br>\u2705 USER-FRIENDLY INTERFACE: Our app is designed with simplicity and usability in mind. Easily manage your location sharing settings through our intuitive interface.<br><br>Download Location Share now!<br><br>Statement:<br>1. Location Share is an application that can only share location information with the consent of both parties.<br>2.Location Share only needs a few permissions (mainly location permissions, notification permissions) to protect your network privacy.<br>3.Location Share is not a spy or secret surveillance app.",
